<title>UK: IRAQ AUGUST CEYHAN OIL EXPORT SCHEDULE.</title>
<headline>IRAQ AUGUST CEYHAN OIL EXPORT SCHEDULE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
